<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>System Maintenance Notification</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f3f6f9;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      color: #333;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .header {
      background-color: #0c4a6e;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .body {
      padding: 30px 25px;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .highlight {
      color: #007bff;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .cta {
      margin-top: 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta a {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0c4a6e;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cta a:hover {
      background-color: #083c56;
    }

    .footer {
      background-color: #f0f2f5;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #777;
      border-top: 1px solid #e1e1e1;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #0c4a6e;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 6px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .body {
        padding: 20px 15px;
      }

      .header {
        font-size: 20px;
        padding: 20px 15px;
      }

      .cta a {
        padding: 10px 20px;
        font-size: 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      🛠 Scheduled Maintenance Notification
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>We would like to inform you that <strong>EngageGPT</strong> will be undergoing a scheduled system maintenance window.</p>

      <p>The system will be temporarily unavailable from:</p>
      <p class="highlight">{{startTime}}</p>
      <p>to</p>
      <p class="highlight">{{endTime}}</p>

      <p>During this time, access to EngageGPT's dashboard and AI tools will be restricted.</p>

      <p>We recommend planning your tasks accordingly. We apologize for any inconvenience caused and appreciate your patience.</p>

      <div class="cta">
        <a href="https://engagegpt.in/support" target="_blank">Contact Support</a>
      </div>

      <p>Thanks for being part of EngageGPT!</p>
      <p>— The EngageGPT Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} EngageGPT. All rights reserved.<br />
      <a href="https://engagegpt.in">Website</a> |
      <a href="mailto:engagegpt@gmail.com">Support</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
